    404, CSRF 403, 422). Approved in the security-reviewer role on #52.
    WP-13 part 3 adds POST /cases/{number}/comments/pin and /unpin (CSRF, behind login): CaseCommentService reads
    through the person's CaseScope (404 if unreadable) and checks PIN against the matrix (403), rebuilding
    permissions from the database per request, before the submitted comment id is looked at; an id naming no comment
