    and clamped. The stored HTML is read back from REPORT_RUN and passed through StoredReportSanitizer (OWASP
    allow-list: table elements, a p div span, scope colspan class, href only /cases/ plus a case number) into
    SafeHtml, written only through tk:safe; team names are echoed through th:text. The download carries the stored
    CSV (written by CsvFormat when the run was made) as an attachment named from the run's id and day, nosniff and
